{
  "project": "jeon2019_optics",
  "stage": "stage01",
  "description": "阶段 01（修正版）：建立并验证 Fresnel 传播基线。不实现 DOE 高度、多波长编码 PSF、成像或重建。",
  "runtime": {
    "device": "cpu",
    "save_results": false,
    "show_plots": false,
    "log_level": "INFO",
    "numpy_random_seed": 0,
    "force_new_run": false
  },
  "units": {
    "internal_length_unit": "m",
    "note": "所有长度在进入 optics 模块前统一换算为米。nm/um/mm 只出现在配置解析层与报告文字中。"
  },
  "studies": {
    "airy": {
      "enabled": true,
      "comment": "A. 理想薄透镜焦平面的 Airy 尺度。z=f 时透镜相位与传播展开式的输入二次相位相消，焦平面就是孔径的 Fourier 强度，因此不要求 D²/(4λf)≪1。低阶与高阶采样/近轴条件仍逐项检查。",
      "wavelength_nm": 550.0,
      "cases": [
        {
          "name": "D0.1mm_f50mm",
          "aperture_diameter_mm": 0.1,
          "f_mm": 50.0,
          "input_half_width_um": 300.0,
          "input_spacing_um": 0.5,
          "output_spacing_um": 3.0,
          "energy_evaluation": {
            "R_over_r1": 4.0,
            "method": "direct_window",
            "samples_per_dark_ring": 40,
            "fft_size": 2048,
            "max_R_over_window_half": 0.5
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "D0.2mm_f25mm",
          "aperture_diameter_mm": 0.2,
          "f_mm": 25.0,
          "input_half_width_um": 300.0,
          "input_spacing_um": 0.5,
          "output_spacing_um": 0.8,
          "energy_evaluation": {
            "R_over_r1": 4.0,
            "method": "direct_window",
            "samples_per_dark_ring": 40,
            "fft_size": 2048,
            "max_R_over_window_half": 0.5
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "D1.0mm_f50mm",
          "aperture_diameter_mm": 1.0,
          "f_mm": 50.0,
          "input_half_width_um": 1200.0,
          "input_spacing_um": 1.0,
          "output_spacing_um": 0.35,
          "energy_evaluation": {
            "R_over_r1": 4.0,
            "method": "direct_window",
            "samples_per_dark_ring": 40,
            "fft_size": 8192,
            "max_R_over_window_half": 0.5
          }
        }
      ],
      "paper_scale_reference": {
        "D_mm": 1.0,
        "f_mm": 50.0,
        "wavelength_nm": 550.0,
        "comment": "论文第 6 节实物尺度（DOE 直径 1 mm、焦距 50 mm）。本阶段已用与 cases[2] 相同的参数实际求值中心截线并保存二维复场。"
      }
    },
    "direct_vs_fft": {
      "enabled": true,
      "comment": "B. 离散恒等：同一离散输入、同一原生输出网格、同一面积权重下，单次 FFT 必须等于完整位移核求和。可直接拦截漏面积权重 / 频率未中心化 / 重复相位 / 索引互换。",
      "wavelength_nm": 550.0,
      "propagation_distance_mm": 50.0,
      "cases": [
        {
          "input_samples": 48,
          "input_spacing_um": 40.0,
          "fft_size": 96
        },
        {
          "input_samples": 24,
          "input_spacing_um": 10.0,
          "fft_size": 48
        },
        {
          "input_samples": 64,
          "input_spacing_um": 5.0,
          "fft_size": 256
        }
      ]
    },
    "energy": {
      "enabled": true,
      "comment": "C. 主判据：原生 FFT 全输出 Parseval 检验（≤1e-10）。另有按 P_disk/P_in 唯一口径的绝对包围能量对解析 1-J0²-J1²。",
      "wavelength_nm": 550.0,
      "propagation_distance_mm": 50.0,
      "parseval_cases": [
        {
          "input_samples": 48,
          "input_spacing_um": 40.0,
          "fft_size": 96
        },
        {
          "input_samples": 64,
          "input_spacing_um": 5.0,
          "fft_size": 256
        }
      ],
      "airy_window_case": {
        "aperture_diameter_mm": 1.0,
        "f_mm": 50.0,
        "input_half_width_um": 1200.0,
        "input_spacing_um": 1.0,
        "comment": "与 A 组第三个算例同参数。输出间距由 energy_levels 逐级给出。"
      },
      "energy_levels": [
        {
          "name": "direct20_R4r1",
          "method": "direct_window",
          "samples_per_dark_ring": 20,
          "R_over_r1": 4.0,
          "fft_size": 4096
        },
        {
          "name": "direct40_R4r1",
          "method": "direct_window",
          "samples_per_dark_ring": 40,
          "R_over_r1": 4.0,
          "fft_size": 8192
        }
      ],
      "energy_max_R_over_window_half": 0.5
    },
    "sampling": {
      "enabled": true,
      "comment": "D. 分开验收三类完全不同的量：D1 输入采样收敛（固定器件与公共输出坐标）、D2 输出采样/填充收敛（固定同一离散输入，真实改变 M，公共探测器网格 + 直接核参考）、D3 离散算法恒等（FFT vs 完整位移核）。三者不得互相替代。",
      "wavelength_nm": 550.0,
      "propagation_distance_mm": 50.0,
      "aperture_diameter_mm": 0.1,
      "input_half_width_um": 200.0,
      "input_levels": [
        {
          "name": "dx2.0um",
          "input_spacing_um": 2.0
        },
        {
          "name": "dx1.0um",
          "input_spacing_um": 1.0
        },
        {
          "name": "dx0.5um",
          "input_spacing_um": 0.5
        }
      ],
      "input_level_ax": 2,
      "common_output_half_width_over_r1": 2.0,
      "common_output_spacing_um": 2.0,
      "padding_input_spacing_um": 1.0,
      "padding_levels": [
        {
          "name": "M1024",
          "fft_size": 1024
        },
        {
          "name": "M2048",
          "fft_size": 2048
        }
      ],
      "identity_cases": [
        {
          "name": "identity_N48_dx40um_M96",
          "input_samples": 48,
          "input_spacing_um": 40.0,
          "fft_size": 96
        },
        {
          "name": "identity_N24_dx10um_M48",
          "input_samples": 24,
          "input_spacing_um": 10.0,
          "fft_size": 48
        },
        {
          "name": "identity_N64_dx5um_M256",
          "input_samples": 64,
          "input_spacing_um": 5.0,
          "fft_size": 256
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "acceptance": {
    "airy_first_dark_ring_rel_err_max": 0.02,
    "airy_line_L1_max": 0.01,
    "discrete_identity_rel_l2_max": 1e-06,
    "parseval_rel_err_max": 1e-10,
    "energy_absolute_abs_diff_max": 0.005,
    "input_sampling_intensity_L1_max": 0.02,
    "padding_sampling_intensity_L1_max": 0.02,
    "comment": "以上阈值均为本项目预设验收建议，不是论文数值，也不得在看到结果后放宽。discrete_identity_rel_l2_max 只用于离散算法恒等（复场相对 L2）；input_sampling_intensity_L1_max 与 padding_sampling_intensity_L1_max 只用于公共物理网格上的**原始强度相对 L1**（Σ|Ia−Ib|ΔA / ΣIbΔA），三者是不同指标，不得互换。"
  },
  "groups": {
    "airy": {
      "required": true,
      "label": "A 组：Airy 尺度与绝对包围能量"
    },
    "direct": {
      "required": true,
      "label": "B 组：离散算法恒等"
    },
    "energy": {
      "required": true,
      "label": "C 组：能量（原生 Parseval + 绝对包围能量）"
    },
    "sampling": {
      "required": true,
      "label": "D 组：输入采样收敛与输出采样/填充收敛"
    },
    "comment": "results 字典、报告与验收统一使用这些键名（本轮统一为 direct，不再出现 direct_vs_fft）。required=true 的组在默认阶段 01 完整运行中必须执行并实际测得数值。"
  },
  "plots": {
    "dpi": 130,
    "colormap_intensity": "inferno",
    "colormap_error": "coolwarm"
  }
}